  "title": "Daniela NDE 6941",
  "date": "4 de agosto del 2013",
  "content": "Around 9 in the morning, I woke up with a strong lower abdominal pain. I was in so much pain. When I was asleep, I was dreaming that I had the pain in the dream. I got up as well as I could and went to the bathroom thinking that I needed to pee. When I got up from the toilet, I was already dizzy with hot and cold sweating. I looked at myself in the mirror and I was white as paper. I sat down again. I could not hear well, I could only hear buzzing. Words hardly came out. My vision was all fuzzy. I was feeling very weak, with no strength. I was trying not to faint. I managed to call my parents. They came over and the only thing I could say was ‘I can't, I can't.’ I felt like I was going to fall. When my parents got me up, in that moment I saw myself out of my body. I saw myself, the situation, and I was listening to everything. Then everything went black. All of a sudden, I saw a white bright light. I was listening to murmurs and I said to myself, ‘This is it.’ I let myself fall into my father's arms. During all those moments, first I felt anguish and then fear because I did not know what was happening. Later when seeing myself out of my body, I felt tranquil and in some way, pleasant. When I woke up, I was lying on the floor because I could not hold myself. They took my blood pressure and it was very low. Slowly I recuperated. They have made studies and found nothing. As of today, several months have gone by and I don't know what happened to me or why it happened.",
